3.3 Registration Workflow

Implement the following workflow:

1. Applicant completes registration.
2. System generates a unique application reference.
3. Applicant receives an acknowledgement.
4. Application enters the pending verification queue.
5. Authorized membership officer reviews the information.
6. Officer approves, rejects or requests additional documents.
7. Applicant receives a notification.
8. Approved applicant receives a unique membership number.
9. Digital membership card is automatically generated.
10. Member account is activated.

Membership must not automatically become approved merely because an application has been submitted or payment has been made.

